# ── OS cruft ────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
Thumbs.db
ehthumbs.db
Desktop.ini
.DS_Store
$RECYCLE.BIN/

# ── Editors ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
.vscode/*
!.vscode/extensions.json
.idea/
*.swp
*~

# ── Node (only ever created by `npx serve`; there are no real dependencies) ──
node_modules/
npm-debug.log*
yarn-error.log*
.npm/
package-lock.json

# ── Logs & temp ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
*.log
.tmp/

# NOTE: assets/ is intentionally NOT ignored.
# The photos have to be committed for GitHub Pages to serve them.

# ── Python bytecode ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# serve.py imports tools/build_moments.py, so running the dev server creates
# tools/__pycache__/. One of these was committed by accident in b222d0a.
__pycache__/
*.py[cod]
